  "question": {
    "text": "How many of these compounds can react with ammonical silver nitrate solution to give white ppt.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0001_178cf0ed92cb.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 132px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Terminal alkynes can react with ammonical  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  solution to give white ppt.<br/><br/>Here  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>  and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>  can show this reaction."
  }
